{"title": "Paid the Price (Condition)", "pageid": 6296, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Paid_the_Price_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paid the Price Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Paid_the_Price_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Paid the Price</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You have a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a> checks, but <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks. Additionally, you have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> when attacking Hags. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HAG_HAGEYED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHAG_HAGEYED%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHAG_HAGEYED%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Paid_the_Price\">Sources of Paid the Price</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Accept <a href=\"/wiki/Get_Help_from_Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Get Help from Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel's deal</a> in Act 1, offering the player character's eye in an attempt to have their tadpole removed.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This effect irrevocably changes the appearance of the chosen eye. It cannot be removed and its appearance cannot be changed with the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Mirror\" title=\"Magic Mirror\">Magic Mirror</a>.</li>\n<li>Mutually exclusive with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/25px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/38px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/50px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Volo's Eye\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp/25px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye (passive feature)\">Volo's Eye</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll's</a> stone eye, the player character may only sacrifice one eye to highly suspicious surgeries.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 256px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 254px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paid_the_price_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Gale with his left eye affected by Paid the Price.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Paid_the_price_Gale.png/381px-Paid_the_price_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Paid_the_price_Gale.png/572px-Paid_the_price_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Paid_the_price_Gale.png/762px-Paid_the_price_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale with his left eye affected by Paid the Price.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Paid_the_price_Gale.png/381px-Paid_the_price_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"254\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Paid_the_price_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Gale with his left eye affected by Paid the Price.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195425\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1699/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18431/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8292/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1067/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua 